Notes on the data:
- The BCG-and-TB aggregate counts are from Colditz et al., JAMA 1994, and are
  reproduced as they appear in the metafor R package (dat.bcg). Trial counts are
  facts and are not subject to copyright.
- The zinc and magnesium datasets are simulated for teaching and do not
  represent real trials.
- Copyrighted source papers used elsewhere in the course are NOT included here.
